Column weights of the reading matrices guessed from the weights alone, in the place of the importance matrix. Not planned, nothing scored.
gain: what the weighted arm gains over the plain arm, in dB, with each column counted by its input's mean square over the wikitext-2 training text. Mean over the layers, and the worst layer.
first ten: the share of the input's mean square in the ten columns the guess puts first, in percent, mean over the layers.
